// Relics: one-of-a-kind things a unit takes up as the prize for beating a monster (a lair's "prizes" in
// units.json, { "relic": id }). The nearest of the player's fighting units near the cleared den, without a
// relic already, takes it up. It keeps it when it evolves, and it is gone with it. A unit bears at most one.
//   hp: hit points added to the bearer's most (it gets them at once too)
//   damage: added to each of the bearer's hits
//   armor: added on every part of the bearer
//   icon: the pixel icon (game/scripts/UiIcons.cs), by default the id
[
  { "id": "giant_heart", "name": "Giant's heart", "icon": "giant_heart",
    "description": "The glowing stone heart of a stone giant. Its bearer stands like a hill: more hit points and harder skin.",
    "hp": 60, "armor": 2 }
]
